  "name": "Question 12",
  "problem": "Consider the following inhomogeneous system of linear differential equations:\n\n$$\n{x}^{\u2032}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}-3t+4 \\\\ 2t-1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe complementary solution to this system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{c}(t)={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t}+{c}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThen, the general solution of the system is\n\n| $x(t)={x}_{c}(t)+\\,\\,$ |  | $\\frac{11}{6}$ |  | $\\,\\,t+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  | $\\frac{1}{9}$ |  |  |  |  |",
